From: Delta-Kronecker <220442677+Delta-Kronecker@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 11:43:59 +0330
Subject: [PATCH] Rename project to DeltaTor, update icon

Full rebrand TorJet -> DeltaTor across the Windows launcher:
- rename TorJetUi.cs -> DeltaTorUi.cs, TorJet.ico -> DeltaTor.ico,
  TORJET-CHANGES.md -> DELTATOR-CHANGES.md
- replace all TorJet/TORJET/torjet references in launcher, tor-src
  (incl. US)\n usernames, docs, CI and configs with DeltaTor
- keep-alive SOCKS5 username now deltator-keepalive (C + C# in sync)
- embed new multi-size icon from the user's PNG export (make-icon)
- bump bench harness release default to v2.0.0
